WEBVTT

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:31.698
ambaye amefanya kazi na 
wakulima wadogo Rwanda

00:00:31.722 --> 00:00:34.226
na sasa kama mmiliki wa 
biashara ndogo ya chakula

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.177
ambaye yuko kati ya walaji na wazalishaji

00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:39.936
nimeonyeshwa moja kati ya

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:43.384
tasnia zinazotumia nguvu sana 
kiuchumi na kiikolojia duniani,

00:00:43.408 --> 00:00:44.688
na kupitia kazi yangu,

00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:46.451
nimeona kitu cha ajabu,

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:52.771
wakulima wetu, wanaolisha jamii zetu, 
hawawezi kumudu chakula wanachokilima.

00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:58.767
Leo, mashirika kadhaa yanaendelea kuungana

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.416
mnyororo wote wa usambazaji chakula,